{
 "id": "macd-range-whipsaw-01",
 "title": {
  "en": "MACD Crosses in a Range",
  "bn": "Range-এ MACD cross"
 },
 "symbol": "EURUSD",
 "timeframe": "H4",
 "mode": "synthetic",
 "type": "pattern",
 "bias": "neutral",
 "outcome": "loss",
 "tags": [
  "macd",
  "range",
  "whipsaw"
 ],
 "module": "07-technical-indicators",
 "lessonSlugs": [
  "03-macd"
 ],
 "caption": {
  "en": "In a sideways market the MACD line crosses its signal again and again, and each cross arrives after the swing is mostly finished.",
  "bn": "Sideways বাজারে MACD line বারবার signal কাটে এবং প্রতিটি cross আসে swing প্রায় শেষ হওয়ার পরে।"
 },
 "notes": {
  "en": "Illustrative synthetic data.",
  "bn": "এটি শিক্ষামূলক কাল্পনিক ডেটা।"
 },
 "explanation": {
  "en": "The histogram hugs zero. Frequent crosses with a flat histogram are noise, not signals.",
  "bn": "Histogram zero-র কাছে ঘোরে। Histogram সমতল থাকলে ঘন ঘন cross আসলে noise।"
 },
 "keyTakeaways": [
  {
   "en": "Flat histogram plus frequent crosses means no trend: stand aside",
   "bn": "সমতল histogram ও ঘন ঘন cross মানে trend নেই: বাইরে থাকুন"
  }
 ],
